  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Sets a <a href="http://foldoc.org/index.cgi?query=handle" target="_blank">handle</a> for <b>msg</b> on <b>channel</b> from <b>name</b> and <b>id</b>.</p>
  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/handle" target="_blank">handle</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) that can be used to <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlListenControl" target="_blank">deactivate</a> or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlListenRemove" target="_blank">remove</a> the listen.</p>
</p>
